{"availability":"available","full":"BootBlock/Gubbins","name":"Gubbins","description":"A local-first, offline-capable PWA for tracking anything you own - with barcode/QR scanning, full-text search, component-supplier datasheet scraping, and more.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":2,"created":"2026-06-29T12:05:34Z","updated":"2026-10-10T19:45:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bootblock.github.io/Gubbins/","topics":["3d-printing","barcode-scanner","electronics","full-text-search","homelab","inventory","inventory-management","local-first","offline-first","progressive-web-app","pwa","qr-code","react","sqlite","sqlite-wasm","stock-management","tailwindcss","typescript","vite","webassembly"],"demo":"https://bootblock.github.io/Gubbins/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:10.544Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:10.544Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:10.544Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:53:10.544Z","stars":2,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Gubbins runs entirely in your browser — no install or local server required.","First load registers a service worker and may refresh once — this is expected (it enables the in-browser database). Your data lives in the browser profile you use, so use the same browser to find it again.","A local-first, offline-capable Progressive Web App for tracking anything — electronics, 3D-printing supplies, tools, collections, household items, and general inventory. All data resides and is processed entirely within the user's browser/device."],"features":["Start using it. All data is stored locally on your device (in the browser's OPFS); nothing is sent to a server.","(Optional) Click Install in your browser to add Gubbins as a standalone, offline-capable app.","Track anything: items with categories, custom fields (eleven types, including image and file), weighted capabilities, quantities, photos, and attachments (a URL, or a pointer to a local file).","Hierarchical, colour-coded locations with descriptions, per-location item counts, custom fields that nested locations can inherit, photos you can mark regions on, and optional dimensions so you can see how full a space…","Per-location stock ledger — quantities tracked independently at each location, with transfers between them."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BootBlock/Gubbins/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0f411a80c53836b6f083caae2fa74c2fa7a6e586086d66339ef15328f85d3ad9","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:10.758Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:10.758Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Gubbins runs entirely in your browser — no install or local server required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BootBlock/Gubbins/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Multiple password-protected accounts behind a sign-in gate, off by default — switch it on and Gubbins asks who you are before it opens.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BootBlock/Gubbins/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"required","text":"Because the push comes from a browser, the bridge only accepts it from an origin on its CORS allow-list — the hosted site and loopback by default, so a self-hosted app needs its own origin added via GUBBINSBRIDGEALLOWEDORIGINS.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BootBlock/Gubbins/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0f411a80c53836b6f083caae2fa74c2fa7a6e586086d66339ef15328f85d3ad9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BootBlock/Gubbins/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:10.759Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T19:45:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BootBlock/Gubbins/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:10.762Z","hash":"0f411a80c53836b6f083caae2fa74c2fa7a6e586086d66339ef15328f85d3ad9","originalBytes":37758,"storedBytes":37758,"truncated":false,"sear